      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, margins",
          "value": "<p>May God not forget you from His mercy and by God please, please send me the books in any event! I won\u2019t be at ease until your letters arrive. I already sent you a number of letters, but no response arrived except for only one letter which came with the teacher [who brought them].</p>",
